@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
title Чистые доменные службы
class CatalogPricingService <<DomainService>>
class WarehouseAllocationService <<DomainService>>
class ShipmentPlanningService <<DomainService>>
class PriceQuote <<ValueObject>>
class AllocationPlan <<ValueObject>>
class DispatchPlan <<ValueObject>>
CatalogPricingService --> PriceQuote
WarehouseAllocationService --> AllocationPlan
ShipmentPlanningService --> DispatchPlan
note bottom
DispatchPlan читает несколько Shipment;
каждый dispatch выполняется отдельной Unit of Work.
end note
@enduml
